      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/22-spiny-eels/mastacembelus_tinwini_en/",
      "html": "<p>Other fish are ignored if they are large enough, but small tankmates are taken for food.</p>"
    }
